From 7072c33d942cdef0247cabdee478c84c0137c06d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eddy Sangalli <eddyrodrigues@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:40:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] fix(frontend): guard shutdown reentry and complete
 FreeMix settings metadata

Mark the FreeMix frontend as closing before browser docks begin destruction, block widget inspection and panel creation during shutdown, and schedule panel destruction only once. Return actionable panel errors.

Expose precision, groups and backend state per network sender. Match recording formats to the original OBS settings widget, including hybrid and fragmented MP4/MOV.

Set the FreeMix Windows manifest, application display and taskbar identity; update tray and crash-dialog labels while retaining upstream attribution.
